      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/9/4/9/6",
      "text": [
        ": سألت أبا عبد الله عليه السلام عن قول الله عزوجل فِطْرَتَ اللَّهِ الَّتِي فَطَرَ النَّاسَ عَلَيْهَا قال: فطرهم جميعا على التوحيد"
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.ammaar-muslim": [
          "6. [6/383] al-Tawhid: My father from Sa’d from Ahmad and Abdallah the two sons of Muhammad b. Isa from Ibn Mahbub from Ibn Riab from Zurara who said: I asked Aba Abdillah عليه السلام about the words of Allah Mighty and Majestic: “The Fitra of Allah which He created the people upon” <a href=\"/books/quran:30#h30\">[30:30]</a>. He said: He created them all upon Tawhid."
        ]
      }
